  "faq_heading": "Delta schools: your questions answered",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The BC Ministry of Education and Child Care school list shows 41 schools with a Delta street address: 35 public schools and 6 independent schools. It also shows 1 college or university campus. In that list, 10 schools marked as offering French Immersion, 1 Francophone school run by the Conseil scolaire francophone and 2 online schools."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Public schools here are run by School District 37 (Delta) and School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone). Count by district: School District 37 (Delta): 34, School District 93 (Conseil scolaire francophone): 1."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Alternate programs, continuing education centres and online schools that have a street address sit under \"other public schools and programs\"; the level of every school is read from its name."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Public secondary schools with a Delta address: Burnsview Secondary, Delta Secondary, Delview Secondary, North Delta Secondary, Sands Secondary, Seaquam Secondary and South Delta Secondary."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The Ministry file marks these Delta schools as offering French Immersion: Burnsview Secondary, Chalmers Elementary, Cliff Drive Elementary, Devon Gardens Elementary, Ladner Elementary, Richardson Elementary, Sands Secondary, South Delta Secondary, South Park Elementary and Sunshine Hills Elementary."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Independent schools listed for Delta include Ahmadiyya Muslim School, Boundary Bay Montessori House, Delta Christian School, Immaculate Conception School, Sacred Heart and Southpointe Academy."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Before an offer, ask the district which school serves the exact street address."
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The Delta school district publishes its catchments only as an interactive map, not as a list of streets. Use the district's own page to check an address:",
      "gen": "schools-sup"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Delta school district catchments and school finder",
      "h": "https://www.deltasd.bc.ca/schools/student-registration/catchment-area-maps/",
      "gen": "schools-sup"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The Conseil scolaire francophone publishes its attendance zones (zones de fréquentation) on its own site:",
      "gen": "schools-sup"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Conseil scolaire francophone attendance zones",
      "h": "https://www.csf.bc.ca/transport/zones-de-frequentation/",
      "gen": "schools-sup"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "The district's own school pages also list French Immersion at Burnsview Secondary, Chalmers Elementary, Cliff Drive Elementary, Devon Gardens Elementary, Ladner Elementary, Richardson Elementary, South Delta Secondary, South Park Elementary, and Sunshine Hills Elementary, where the Ministry file flag reads No. Confirm the program with the school before relying on either.",
      "gen": "schools-sup"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Delta is one municipality made up of North Delta, Ladner and Tsawwassen, and this list covers all three."
    },
